teamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/e46355a64e52a722bdfacb1d8c27607b.poster.avif?t=1728917106\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/e46355a64e52a722bdfacb1d8c27607b.webm?t=1728917106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/e46355a64e52a722bdfacb1d8c27607b.mp4?t=1728917106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>From a popcorn grenade to a jelly bean shotgun, find and use unique weapons made from household objects.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/d7d30f0a5a180a44480f7ef50f9a0d1f.poster.avif?t=1728917106\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/d7d30f0a5a180a44480f7ef50f9a0d1f.webm?t=1728917106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/d7d30f0a5a180a44480f7ef50f9a0d1f.mp4?t=1728917106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Earn XP in to unlock special player abilities each game session.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/8e3ff42e6b114cb5704e3c479dec0991.poster.avif?t=1728917106\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/8e3ff42e6b114cb5704e3c479dec0991.webm?t=1728917106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/8e3ff42e6b114cb5704e3c479dec0991.mp4?t=1728917106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use points to unlock new outfits and furs for your teddy bear. Mix and match outfits and furs to fully personalise them.",
